        <item>
            <title>0.2.18</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:03:01 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.18</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Opening "want to be friends" from Add a friend no longer freezes the app.
The list's Refreshing button no longer stays on after the list has updated.
Tray rows now respond to a click anywhere they light up.
The onboarding intro keeps playing when you click outside its window.
Settings > About > Updates has an "Update automatically" switch.
Firstlight now reads only the agent logs it counts, not the settings and sign-in files beside them.
The open Leaderboard no longer shows presence dots that made everyone look offline.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/download/0.2.18/Firstlight-0.2.18.zip" length="43404377" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wziX7evV0JtF0jSK6+d3woWWUkovA6FIhvqUwx6lOvkqIvksaXlu+OL/Rtl2h1Khts8l9QaHZqstZbEesQMxCg=="/>
